sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: From overlapping work to a sequential loop
    accDescr: The first version overlapped model reflection with queued actions; the revised loop waits for execution results before the next decision.
    participant L as LLM
    participant E as Execution
    participant W as Minecraft

    Note over L,W: Initial approach: overlapping work
    L->>E: Queue actions
    par Reflection
        L->>L: Prepare the next decision
    and Execution
        E->>W: Execute a queued action
        W-->>E: Observed result
    end
    E-->>L: Return the result

    Note over L,W: Revised approach: sequential loop
    L->>E: Select one action
    E->>W: Execute the action
    W-->>E: Observed result
    E-->>L: Return the result
    L->>L: Observe and decide again
